{"batchcomplete":"","continue":{"gsroffset":4,"continue":"gsroffset||"},"query":{"pages":{"34920927":{"pageid":34920927,"ns":6,"title":"File:Central South University12.jpg","index":4,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":1992952,"width":2592,"height":1944,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cd/Central_South_University12.jpg/1280px-Central_South_University12.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":1000,"thumbheight":750,"responsiveUrls":{"2":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cd/Central_South_University12.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled"},"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cd/Central_South_University12.jpg/1280px-Central_South_University12.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":1000,"height":750,"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cd/Central_South_University12.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x"},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cd/Central_South_University12.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Central_South_University12.jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=34920927","extmetadata":{"DateTime":{"value":"2014-08-24 12:55:35","source":"mediawiki-metadata","hidden":""},"ObjectName":{"value":"Central South University12","source":"mediawiki-metadata"},"CommonsMetadataExtension":{"value":1.2,"source":"extension","hidden":""},"Categories":{"value":"Taken with Canon Digital IXUS 105|De minimis|Self-published work|FoP-China|Central South University, Main Campus|Busts in Changsha","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Assessments":{"value":"","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"ImageDescription":{"value":"Bust of Chen Xinmin in Central South University. The Bust of Chen Xinmin is located on the main campus of Central South University (the former site of Central South Institute of Mining and Metallurgy). It is a bronze bust with a natural granite pedestal, inscribed with the words \"Portrait of Mr. Chen Xinmin\" and calligraphic inscriptions by Qian Weichang and Fei Xiaotong. It was created in 2002 to commemorate the 90th birthday of Academician Chen Xinmin. Inscriptions on the pedestal: \"Portrait of Mr. Chen Xinmin\"; Inscription by Qian Weichang: \"A model of seeking truth and a paragon of academic pursuit\", with the signature: \"To commemorate the 90th birthday of Academician Chen Xinmin, Qian Weichang, December 1, 2002\"; Inscription by Fei Xiaotong: \"Selfless dedication, a model for later generations\", with the signature: \"Fei Xiaotong, at the age of 93\". Chen Xinmin (November 18, 1912 \u2013 December 23, 1992), a native of Qingyuan County, Hebei Province, graduated from Tsinghua University in 1935 and received his doctorate from the Massachusetts Institute of Technology in 1945. He was a renowned Chinese physical chemist in metallurgy, educator, and academician of the Chinese Academy of Sciences. He served as the first president of Central South Institute of Mining and Metallurgy (the predecessor of Central South University) and was a pioneer of non-ferrous metals metallurgy education in China.  <b>Note: The calligraphic artwork of the name in regular script and the calligraphic inscriptions by Qian Weichang and Fei Xiaotong on the pedestal are not in the public domain.</b>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2014-08-23 17:06:52","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<span class=\"int-own-work\" lang=\"en\">Own work</span>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"Uploaded by <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:Huangdan2060\" ti